    "observation": "The matched-half-step promotion deficit is present in all three critical RF-phase octants and is strongest at phase 0.25--0.375, where the two AuroraPIC/native ratios are 0.7549 and 0.7916. Over phase 0.125--0.5 the upstream x/L=0.1--0.2 ratios are 0.8902 and 0.9038, then fall in x/L=0.2--0.4 to 0.7729 and 0.8011. The field-push traffic discrepancy therefore spans the critical phase window and amplifies immediately beyond the upstream region rather than arising in one isolated phase."
